bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    seed_jit_hoisted_loop_data_ptr_reaches_generic_array_get_2026-11-27, 1, "2026-11-27 opus-bugbatch fix. lower_index_expr re-lowers the receiver (the array handle) for the generic rt_array_get / rt_array_get_text / rt_index_get arms when a hoisted data pointer is active (array_handle_for_generic_get); the typed [u8]/[u32]/[u64] arms keep the hoisted pointer, so their hot loops are unchanged. Red->green: compiler/tests/seed_jit_hoisted_loop_generic_elements.rs ([f64] [7.5, 2.25] sum*100 gave 0, want 975; also [i32], [i16], [text], parameter and local) -> 2 passed. e2e on seed c3f521ba19bf8db2: [f64] 7.5, [i32]/[i16] 7, [text] ab, same as interpreter. Perf, 1e9 reads, 3 alternated rounds vs parent 4038b7f7ec6 (load 11-18): best hoisted [u64] 1.75 vs 1.77 s, [u32] at 1.57 vs 1.57 s, RSS 41 MB both: no regression. Compiler lib: 12 failures as on origin plus the order-dependent seed_builtin_discriminants_are_the_declared_ordinal (passes alone)."

